2-qadam: Universal Dockerfile yaratish
Python muhitini avtomat sozlash uchun ushbu universal kodni terminalga tashlang:

Bash
cat << 'EOF' > Dockerfile
FROM python:3.12-slim
WORKDIR /app
COPY requirements.txt .
RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt
COPY . .
CMD ["python", "bot.py"]
EOF
3-qadam: docker-compose.yml faylini yangilash
Bot va ma'lumotlar bazasini bir-biriga bog‘laydigan arxitekturani yaratish uchun ushbu kodni terminalga kiritasiz:

Bash
cat << 'EOF' > docker-compose.yml
services:
  db:
    image: postgres:15-alpine
    restart: always
    environment:
      POSTGRES_USER: ${POSTGRES_USER}
      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}
      POSTGRES_DB: ${POSTGRES_DB}
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD-SHELL", "pg_isready -U ${POSTGRES_USER} -d ${POSTGRES_DB}"]
      interval: 5s
      timeout: 5s
      retries: 5
    volumes:
      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data

  bot:
    build: .
    restart: always
    depends_on:
      db:
        condition: service_healthy
    environment:
      - BOT_TOKEN=${BOT_TOKEN}
      - ADMIN_ID=${ADMIN_ID}
      - DATABASE_URL=postgresql://${POSTGRES_USER}:${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}@db:5432/${POSTGRES_DB}

volumes:
  postgres_data:
EOF
4-qadam: Botingizdagi config.py ni tekshirish
PyCharm darchasidan config.py (yoki bot parametrlari turgan fayl) ichiga kirib, DATABASE_URL qismida localhost emas, db yozilganiga ishonch hosil qiling:

Python
DATABASE_URL = os.getenv("DATABASE_URL", "postgresql://postgres:postgres@db:5432/postgres")
5-qadam: Loyihani ishga tushirish (Fonda)
Hamma fayllar tayyor bo‘lgach, loyihani birinchi marta yig‘ish (build) va fonda ishga tushirish buyrug‘ini berasiz:

Bash
docker compose up -d --build
6-qadam: Loyihani to‘xtatish (Xohlagan paytingizda)
Ishingiz tugab, kompyuter xotirasini bo‘shatmoqchi bo‘lsangiz:

Bash
docker compose down
